  "annotations_dropped": [
    {
      "annotation_id": "4a8f5e712e7c4f35a0eb5507eccf9dc4_36",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nIt is stated that the sample was put in the transparent box by the officials of the respondent whereas the appellants were selling the product as per the desired quantity to be purchased by the customers."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "76747887bb0346ed8caf1c026fb104c4_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The observation made vide order dated 16.01.2024 by this court is reproduced as follows :\n\"A round transparent pack duly sealed with the transparent tape is taken out."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f45d7fb543084a8ebd3b219ac3438b59_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the top of it, it bears sticker of:-\nBIKANER Sweet House F-14/17 Model Town-II.\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "59b309673f0741ff8a28205f188c2930_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the bottom of it, it bears following two stickers:-\nThis Pack is Exclusively Prepared at Bikaner Sweet House Model Town BIKANER SWEET HOUSE F-14/17, Model Town lind, New Delhi-110009 Ph:011-27110558,\n27245374"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6eaa8f6cc8c34c03bf4f2686ac0c276b_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Customer Care no. :9868168476 Email:rajesh.gupta1312@yahoo.com KAJU PISTA DANDA QUANTITY-400gm RATE-148/0 MFD."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2ec9b0933bb94def949794f5fbce19ae_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "DATE Apr 2019 Thereafter a round pack is returned to the Ld. SPP for the respondent to be sealed with the court seal\"."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "692171bcfeaa4c56b99d078459e3f71d_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "8. The observation made by this court in its order dated 16.01.2024 mentioned above, belies the submission made by Ld. Counsel for the appellants."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a0b60cac58044ed8adae9db8d20afaa1_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The fixation of the sticker at the bottom of the pack clearly mentions that this is a pack of \"Kaju Pista Danda (Biscuits)\" containing 400 grams quantity and also rate is found mentioned."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "61f78597ecf843e388e200df4beb7e45_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Perusal of the impugned order reveals that submissions made by appellants in its counter reply/written submissions are not at all discussed by the Adjudicating Officer in this impugned order."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5441fb0701b34899991e401e717a6706_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As already mentioned that Rule 3.1.2.(3) of the Act desires that the Adjudicating Authority is required to give brief reasons for its decision."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4548e63c2df74768b414c33a0eb3eb32_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Moreover, principles of Rajesh Gupta And Anr vs State, Through Food Safety Officer on 23 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/50018580/\n4 natural justice provide that no one should be condemn unheard."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "409425103bc546cd96936c308b880cd9_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hearing given to the affected party means that not only factum of giving hearing to him should be mentioned but his representations,\nwritten or oral, are also required to be considered and reasons for not accepting the submissions are requi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3542bad0510d45cea37f70fcdaf258fd_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is observed that in most of the cases, the Adjudicating Officers are not giving reasons for disbelieving the submissions made by the affected private party."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9b0ae2a964c749e987fa44970c4d0558_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10. Though the Adjudicating Officer has not given the reasons on which he has based his impugned order but despite that I find no illegality in the impugned order solely on this count."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f847bfa258c24bb39ab613985c921a22_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. Other contention raised on behalf of the appellants is that no public witness was engaged by the respondent to prove their case and instead of that, they have made their own Officer a witness to the proceedings."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d65b8ed34b3a4e13a2f0eade6e3a7bb2_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The joining of a public witness is not a prerequisite as per law while sealing the product seized from the FBO."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "843fbe6eacf548c99884618a5d754233_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "I find no reason to assume that the respondent had put the \"Kaju Pista Danda (Biscuits)\" in the sealed plastic pack with the sole purpose to falsely implicate the appellants in this case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8e7cfbcd7a164100ad283973f21e8402_56",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n12. In view of the aforesaid reasons, I find no merit in this appeal and same is thereby dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4cb0dc22fa7049f897be82dc16e61abf_57",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "13. The record of the Adjudicating Officer/Addl. District Magistrate along-with copy of this Judgment be sent back."
    }
  ],
